* Multi-site monitoring
* Additional scraping providers
* Intelligent notifications
* Human-in-the-loop recovery for complex failures

---

## Vision

The web is constantly changing.

A reliable data pipeline shouldn't require a developer to manually repair it every time a website changes its structure.

WebSentinel is an attempt to make web extraction more resilient by combining **monitoring, validation, AI-assisted diagnosis, and automated recovery** into one workflow.

### WebSentinel

**Keep your web data pipelines running as the web changes.**
